# Full playthrough, title screen to the sportsman ending (see README.md).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --ms 600000 --input tools/play/full.input [--dump DIR]
#
# The run is deterministic (headless virtual clock): the random choices
# (roadblock cop, hall doors, TIRO's targets, ENCAIXE's pieces, bar quiz question) depend
# on the time of the calls, so changing the timing of an earlier line can
# change them. With the fixes, leave out the two that change the route
# (README.md):
#   --fix all,-avi_exit_ignores_timer
# The hall's TIRO and the pharaoh's ENCAIXE are the real minigames (scripted
# wins, tools/tiro_plan.py and tools/encaixe_plan.py); with
# `--minigame-stub` the run fails at their `result` lines.

# Title menu: JOGAR, then NOVO JOGO; the opening video ends in the bedroom.
22000 dump title
22000 click 290 345
+1500 click 370 412
+1000 wait 1fquarbo 200000
+1000 dump bedroom

